## Changelog

### v0.5.0
- **Reports:** added `market_weekly` (weekly market report) and `theme` (theme performance report).
- **`kind` normalized** to five canonical values (`twitter_daily`, `youtube_daily`, `market_daily`, `market_weekly`, `theme`). Legacy short names `twitter` / `youtube` / `market` still accepted as aliases.
- All report tools return only a public `share_url`; no report inlines its body (`content_markdown` is always null) — twitter/youtube markdown bodies are no longer returned.
- Removed legacy v0.1 HTTP stubs (`/search`, `/reports/twitter-daily/*`, `/reports/youtube-daily/*`) that previously returned 410 Gone.

### v0.4.0
- Added `market` (daily market report) kind to the report tools.

### v0.3.0
- Added v2 semantic / vector RAG tools: `semantic_search`, `hybrid_search`, `chunks_by_locator`.

### v0.2.0
- Consolidated per-source report tools under `kind=` (`report_latest` / `report_by_date` / `report_list`), replacing the old `twitter_daily_*` / `youtube_daily_*` tools.
- `daily_feed` with `q=` replaced `search`; `tickers` (comma-separated, with exchange suffix) replaced the single `ticker` param.
